  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4cd86166deead96458db596b2862e41a, type: 3}
  m_Name: Docks4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Question
  questionText: What do you think of your accommodation from Mayor Bunyon?
  largeQuestionBox: 1
  conversation:
  - "Uhhh... it\u2019s <i>fine?</i> I <i>guess?</i>"
  - "I mean it isn\u2019t <i>great</i>."
  - I've noticed that sometimes people have just <i>come in</i> and, like, gone through
    my stuff, which I don't <i>love</i>.
  - "But it\u2019s also not, you know, <i>the street</i>."
  - "It definitely doesn\u2019t mean I love Bunyon for it though, and I\u2019m sure
    you don\u2019t either, right?"
  - "Like, <i>come on</i>, he\u2019s so... <i>so...</i>"
  - "Fake! <i>Right?</i> He\u2019s so <i>fake</i>. His words are fake, even his <i>smile\u2019s</i>
    fake."
  - "The second I get the chance I\u2019m outta here. Don\u2019t owe him or this
    place anything."
  - "It\u2019ll be easy too. There isn\u2019t a single damn thing I care about in
    this stupid town."
  - "...what are you\u2014 what are you even talking about?"
  - "Wait, they didn\u2019t say anything did they?"
  - "Oh shit, they think <i>I</i> did it, don\u2019t they? They sent you after me?"
  - "I\u2019m\u2013 <i>I didn\u2019t mean\u2014</i> shit! I\u2019m sorry!"
  - ...
  - "...oh wait, you don\u2019t\u2013 you don\u2019t know what I\u2019m talking about,
    do you?"
  - ...
  - "Okay wait, <i>wait</i>. I just realised how that sounded. I wasn\u2019t talking
    about the murder!"
  - "I wasn\u2019t talking about <i>anything</i>. Spider wouldn\u2019t have said
    anything anyway because nothing actually happened, I just got <i>confused</i>."
  - "<i>...What?</i> I\u2013 I didn\u2019t even <i>know.</i>"
  - Well, okay, but what does that have to do with me?
  - "What would\u2013 I don\u2019t even have a reason for <i>needing</i> a gun!"
  - '[MASK SHATTERS]'
  - ...
  - They... they really...
  - ...
  - I... I was going to give it <i>back.</i>
  - I just wanted to feel <i>safe</i> for once. I thought that once I got my own
    place, that things would be <i>different.</i>
  - "But it\u2019s the same. It\u2019s always gonna be the <i>same</i>. I get back
    to my place\u2014 <i>what\u2019s supposed to be my home, right?</i> And people
    have just been coming in and going through my <i>shit.</i>"
  - God, I think one or two times people <i>actually</i> came in when I was <i>sleeping!</i>
  - "Can you understand how that feels? To feel like you\u2019re never allowed to
    have your own space, no matter where you go?"
  - "Like at any waking moment, someone can just violate that space, and there\u2019s
    nothing you can do? It\u2019s suffocating! It\u2019s so fucking <i>scary!</i>"
  - "Please tell me you understand! I need to know that someone else can understand
    what I\u2019m saying!"
  - Because I need... I need <i>them</i> to understand. I need Spider to forgive
    me...
  - "They\u2019re all I have in this stupid town, and I risked it all for <i>nothing.</i>"
  - ...sniff...
  - "...Look, here it is. You can give it back. I\u2019ll talk to them later, I just...
    I just need some time."
  - "I\u2019ve been careful with it. <i>Really.</i> I never even fired it, and I
    kept it out of the water."
  - "And... <i>look</i>, to thank you properly, because I\u2014 I <i>really</i> appreciate
    this, I\u2019ll tell you something else."
  - "When I left after setting off my fireworks last night, which would\u2019ve been,
    like, three hours afterwards, I cut through the Town Square."
  - When I did...
  - I <i>saw</i> it happen.
  - "It was dark, and I wasn\u2019t close enough to see everything, but I saw something
    <i>drop</i> from the Mayor\u2019s balcony and onto the wires."
  - I... I got scared and ran home.
  - "I didn\u2019t say anything about it until now \u2018cause... I didn\u2019t want
    to incriminate anyone."
  - So I hope that helps.
  - ...
  - I really hope they forgive me.
  - "I mean, how else am I gonna hear about all the weird kinks people have? There\u2019s
    someone walking around here who gets off to being pelted with rocks!"
  - "Like I\u2019ve had to keep a straight face when calling out this guy\u2019s
    bruises 'cause they said they\u2019d just been caught in a 'small rockslide'."
  - Or like, that one of the handy- uh- <i>people</i>, likes wrinkly feet? Like,
    <i>fell asleep in the bath for 3 hours</i> wrinkly?
  - Oh shit, wait... we only have, like, one handy person.
  - "...Don\u2019t tell Spider I said that."
